---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<PageLayout title="Around strokes" slug="around-strokes">
  <div class="monologue">
    Wiggly lines are fun. They have a playful, doodle-like feel. You can draw them with any tool, but the strokes on this page add wiggles whether you want them or not.
    <div class="jp">くねくねした線は楽しくて、いかにも落書きらしい遊び心のある雰囲気があります。どんな道具でもくねくねした線は描けますが、このページのストロークは、望むと望まざるとにかかわらず、勝手にくねくねします。</div>
  </div>

  <section class="demo-section" id="around-strokes">
    <div class="demo-header">
      <h2>Around strokes</h2>
      <a href={`${base}/demos/around-strokes/index.html`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">open full size ↗</a>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-embed">
      <iframe src={`${base}/demos/around-strokes/index.html?embedded`} title="Around strokes" scrolling="no"></iframe>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>These paths are derived from the base path and drawn as new strokes.</p>
      <div class="jp">元のパスから導いたパスを、新たな筆跡として描画します。</div>

      <p><strong>Spiral:</strong> The tip circles using sin and cos while its center moves along the base path, producing one continuous coil. It completes one turn for each cycle of arc length, so every loop advances the same distance regardless of the stroke's length.</p>
      <div class="jp"><strong>スパイラル：</strong>中心が元のパスに沿って進むあいだ、先端がsinとcosで円を描き、一本の連続したコイルになります。弧長のcycleごとに1回転するため、ストロークの長さによらず、それぞれのループは同じ距離だけ進みます。</div>

      <p><strong>Entangled:</strong> Copies of the path are offset by seeded low-frequency waves. The wave count scales with the path's length, keeping the wiggles evenly spaced on both long and short strokes.</p>
      <div class="jp"><strong>もつれ：</strong>パスの複製を、シード付きの低周波の波でずらします。波の数はパスの長さに応じて変わるため、長いストロークでも短いストロークでも、同じ間隔で揺れます。</div>

      <p><strong>Scattered:</strong> Short strokes copy small segments of the base path and shift sideways by a seeded offset. The stroke count scales with the path's length, maintaining the scatter's density as the path grows. This one would arguably fit better on the <a href={`${base}/patterned-strokes`}>patterned strokes</a> page.</p>
      <div class="jp"><strong>散布：</strong>元のパスの一部を写し取った短いストロークを、シード付きのオフセットで横にずらします。本数はパスの長さに応じて変わるため、パスが長くなっても散らばりの密度を保ちます。この筆跡は、どちらかといえば <a href={`${base}/patterned-strokes`}>patterned strokes</a> のページに合うかもしれません。</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="demo-section" id="wiggle">
    <div class="demo-header">
      <h2>Wiggle</h2>
      <a href={`${base}/demos/wiggle-strokes/index.html`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">open full size ↗</a>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-embed">
      <iframe src={`${base}/demos/wiggle-strokes/index.html?embedded`} title="Wiggle" scrolling="no"></iframe>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>A single path weaves from side to side across the base path. The width controls the wave's amplitude and scales the overall shape, while the wavelength is a fixed distance in pixels. The brush line's thickness is calculated from these two values and kept between 2 and 6 pixels to remain proportional to the shape. The number of waves scales with the path's length, keeping the pattern consistent across strokes.</p>
      <div class="jp">一本のパスが、元のパスを左右に横切りながら進みます。幅は波の振幅を決め、形全体の大きさを変えます。一方、波長はピクセル単位の固定値です。波をなぞる筆の線幅は、この2つの値から算出し、2〜6ピクセルの範囲に収めて、形との釣り合いを保ちます。波の数はパスの長さに応じて変わるため、どのストロークでも一貫したパターンになります。</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="demo-section" id="try">
    <div class="demo-header">
      <h2>Try drawing</h2>
      <a href={`${base}/demos/try-around-strokes/index.html`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">open full size ↗</a>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-embed" data-w="860" data-h="620" style="width:860px;height:620px">
      <iframe src={`${base}/demos/try-around-strokes/index.html?embedded`} title="Try drawing" scrolling="no" style="width:860px;height:620px"></iframe>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Try drawing freely with the tools on this page.</p>
      <div class="jp">このページのツールで自由に描いてみましょう。</div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
